Use alloc, core.

Let p be allocate 16 bytes.
Set p[0] to 65.
Set p[15] to 66.
Let q be resize memory at p from 16 to 131072.
If q is empty.
Stop with error "realloc null".
End the condition.
If q[0] is not 65.
Stop with error "realloc lost first".
End the condition.
If q[15] is not 66.
Stop with error "realloc lost last".
End the condition.
Release memory at q.
Let used be bytes in use.
If used is not 0.
Stop with error "realloc leak".
End the condition.
Give back 0.
